      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "In my opinion that's way too much technical work to implement for such small convenience. While not very accurate, you already have an option by hotkey to switch between string to string ID, which is way more than enough. They should just somehow fix the IDs to be consistent.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
