  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "This feature occured to me in my dream. I'm not kidding.\n\nTwo button on the right of every string, or all string that's implementable. \n\nOne to *unapprove* the string. This could be useful for marking strings in-game and distinguising strings that share the same localization and origianal text.\n\nAnother to *flag* the string, maybe by adding a \"flagged\" tag onto the string so it can be filtered out on Crowdin. Maybe hard or impracticle to implement, due all languages sharing the same tag, but would be really helpful.",
